## Tutorials

CSS can be used to create HTML link buttons:

### Code Examples

```
a:link, a:visited {
background-color: #f44336;
color: white;
padding: 14px 25px;
text-align: center;
text-decoration: none;
display: inline-block;
}
a:hover, a:active {
background-color: red;
}

---

a:link, a:visited {
background-color: white;
color: black;
border: 2px solid green;
padding: 10px 20px;
text-align: 
  center;
text-decoration: none;
display: inline-block;
}
a:hover, a:active 
  {
background-color: green;
color: white;
}
```

